# The Table presets: the Wavetable synth's nine, folded into Poly (19 Nov,
# wave 2 of the synth library), converted by wavetable::to_poly with times
# rounded to three figures and levels to a tenth of a dB. Both oscillators
# play the Table wave. tests/wavetable_to_poly.rs checks that each plays as
# the Wavetable synth's did.

